  "details": "Tonight I've spent a good few hours in Thad Home of Cuddles with a small group on Desktop and usually my frames remain consistent. But tonight my performance kept getting worse and worse to the point where navigating the quick menu, world ui, and big menu lags me to SINGLE DIGITS and I can't click for some seconds. I rejoined the world twice and went back to my home world, only restarting VRChat fixed the issue so it feels a lot like this is a memory leak issue. \n\n(I also for some reason have worse performance on desktop vs PCVR but that's another issue.)",
